{
  "refId": "1285699",
  "name": "KVS Castings Ltd",
  "url": "http://www.kvscastings.com",
  "about": "Incorporated in 2005, KVS Castings Limited is engaged in the manufacturing of cast iron, SG iron, alloy steel, and stainless steel castings.[1]",
  "keyPoints": "Business profile[1]\nKVS Castings Limited is the foundry division of the KVS Premier Group that manufactures ferrous castings (cast iron and ductile iron) and supplies finished/partially finished castings and machined sub-assemblies across automotive, railways, farm/tractor, heavy machinery, and power sectors.\nProduct Portfolio[2]\n1. Automotive Components (Passenger, Commercial & EVs)\n Brake drums (PC, CV, tractors, EV buses)\n Wheel hubs, bearing caps\n Differential housings, axle housings\n Steering knuckles, control arms\nFlywheel housings, clutch housings\nGearbox casings, transmission parts\n Other powertrain & suspension castings\n2. Railway Components[3]\nBrake beams\nBuffer casings\nAir brake system components\nMounting brackets\nOther approved castings under RDSO certification\n3. Farm & Tractor Components[4]\nPTO housings\nManifolds (exhaust & intake)\nBrake housings\nTransmission housings\nOther heavy-duty tractor sub-assemblies\n4. Heavy Engineering, Sugar & Energy Sector[5]\nGearbox housings\n Crown pinion housings\nInsulator caps (power transmission)\nSugar machinery castings (gear cases, drive housings)\n Energy sector parts for heavy-duty equipment",
